Electronic invoicing connectors
===============================

Each PHP file in this directory may define one or more classes extending
BillingElectronicInvoiceConnector and register an instance with
billing_einvoice_register_connector().

The accounting core must stay provider-neutral: provider URLs, authentication,
status mappings and transport quirks belong here, not in billing tables or UI.
Secrets should preferably be referenced from the connector configuration rather
than stored directly in school.electronic_invoice_connector_configuration_json.
